    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An elevator infested with parasitic creatures. You are trapped in this space. Observe your surroundings carefully and operate the elevator correctly to escape. This is a short walking simulator that gives players a sense of tension and anxiety. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How to play this game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mysterious life forms are hiding in the corridor after you get off the elevator.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find all the hidden life forms in the corridor and remember how many there are.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>The floor buttons</u></strong> inside the elevator are linked to <strong><u>the number of life forms</u></strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To proceed to the next floor, you need to go to the floor that corresponds to the number of life forms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737310/extras/804491db9dd552458d7501e8c5e8686c.poster.avif?t=1748759011\" width=400 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737310/extras/804491db9dd552458d7501e8c5e8686c.webm?t=1748759011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737310/extras/804491db9dd552458d7501e8c5e8686c.mp4?t=1748759011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For example, suppose you find <u><strong>two life forms</strong></u> in the corridor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To get closer to the escape exit, you need to get in the elevator and go to the <u><strong>2nd floor</strong></u>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you go to the wrong floor even once, all of your progress will be reset, and you will be forcibly returned to the starting point.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operate the elevator correctly in succession and reach the escape exit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737310/extras/31cac60770fa86b1cfc2fdf2e1d8a113.poster.avif?t=1748759011\" width=400 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737310/extras/31cac60770fa86b1cfc2fdf2e1d8a113.webm?t=1748759011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737310/extras/31cac60770fa86b1cfc2fdf2e1d8a113.mp4?t=1748759011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737310/extras/6840dd6cc9d20b27b716e60a7eadfc13.poster.avif?t=1748759011\" width=400 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737310/extras/6840dd6cc9d20b27b716e60a7eadfc13.webm?t=1748759011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737310/extras/6840dd6cc9d20b27b716e60a7eadfc13.mp4?t=1748759011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An elevator infested with parasitic creatures. You are trapped in this space. Observe your surroundings carefully and operate the elevator correctly to escape. This is a short walking simulator that gives players a sense of tension and anxiety. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How to play this game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mysterious life forms are hiding in the corridor after you get off the elevator.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find all the hidden life forms in the corridor and remember how many there are.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>The floor buttons</u></strong> inside the elevator are linked to <strong><u>the number of life forms</u></strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To proceed to the next floor, you need to go to the floor that corresponds to the number of life forms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737310/extras/804491db9dd552458d7501e8c5e8686c.poster.avif?t=1748759011\" width=400 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737310/extras/804491db9dd552458d7501e8c5e8686c.webm?t=1748759011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737310/extras/804491db9dd552458d7501e8c5e8686c.mp4?t=1748759011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For example, suppose you find <u><strong>two life forms</strong></u> in the corridor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To get closer to the escape exit, you need to get in the elevator and go to the <u><strong>2nd floor</strong></u>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you go to the wrong floor even once, all of your progress will be reset, and you will be forcibly returned to the starting point.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operate the elevator correctly in succession and reach the escape exit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737310/extras/31cac60770fa86b1cfc2fdf2e1d8a113.poster.avif?t=1748759011\" width=400 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737310/extras/31cac60770fa86b1cfc2fdf2e1d8a113.webm?t=1748759011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737310/extras/31cac60770fa86b1cfc2fdf2e1d8a113.mp4?t=1748759011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737310/extras/6840dd6cc9d20b27b716e60a7eadfc13.poster.avif?t=1748759011\" width=400 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737310/extras/6840dd6cc9d20b27b716e60a7eadfc13.webm?t=1748759011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737310/extras/6840dd6cc9d20b27b716e60a7eadfc13.mp4?t=1748759011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
